[CENTER]
[IMG]PLACEHOLDER_1_BANNER — Full-width banner image, JExVote logo + tagline "Reward your community for voting"[/IMG]

[SIZE=5][COLOR=#2ecc71][B]JExVote[/B][/COLOR] — [COLOR=#95a5a6]All-in-One Vote Rewards & Engagement[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[SIZE=3][COLOR=#bdc3c7]Built-in Votifier · Streaks · Streak Freezes · Vote Gifting · Jackpot · Vote Party · Vote Shop · Bedrock Forms · REST API · Multi-language[/COLOR][/SIZE]

[SIZE=2][COLOR=#e74c3c]Supports Votifier v1 (RSA) and NuVotifier v2 (HMAC) — no external Votifier plugin required.[/COLOR][/SIZE]

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
[/CENTER]

[SIZE=4][COLOR=#2ecc71]■[/COLOR] [B]What is JExVote?[/B][/SIZE]

JExVote handles everything related to server voting — from receiving votes off voting sites to rewarding players, tracking streaks, and displaying statistics. It ships with its own Votifier-compatible server built in, so you do not need NuVotifier or any other listener plugin. Just point your vote sites at the configured port and JExVote takes care of the rest.

Votes trigger configurable rewards, feed into a streak system that keeps players coming back, and populate a leaderboard GUI accessible to every player. Admins get full control through commands and hot-reloadable configuration files.


[SIZE=4][COLOR=#2ecc71]■[/COLOR] [B]Feature Overview[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Built-in Votifier server[/B] — Supports both v1 (RSA-encrypted) and v2 (HMAC-SHA256) protocols out of the box. No NuVotifier dependency.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]14 reward types[/B] — Commands, items, XP, currency (JExEconomy/Vault), permissions (LuckPerms), sounds, particles, titles, teleports, composite bundles, choice menus, custom hooks, chance (probability-gated), and lucky (weighted jackpot pool).
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Vote streaks[/B] — Tracks consecutive daily votes with configurable timeout. Milestone rewards at any day threshold you define.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Streak Freezes[/B] — Auto-equipping streak protection. Every player starts with one free freeze. Buy more with vote points. Per-rank cap via permissions.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Vote Gifting[/B] — Keep a friend's streak alive with [ICODE]/vote gift <player>[/ICODE] or gift a random online player. Configurable daily limit with per-rank permissions.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Vote Jackpot[/B] — Weighted prize pool rolled on every vote. Drop odds and drop counts visible in the rewards menu.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Vote Party[/B] [I](Premium)[/I] — Shared server-wide counter. When the target is reached, every contributor is rewarded. Counter resets automatically.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Vote Shop[/B] [I](Premium)[/I] — Spend vote points on a curated catalog of items. Per-item description preview and thematic icons.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Weekend Multipliers[/B] [I](Premium)[/I] — Scale vote points and reward amounts during configurable day windows.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Per-site rewards[/B] — Assign bonus rewards for specific vote sites on top of the default reward set.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Offline vote queue[/B] — Votes received while a player is offline are stored and delivered on next login.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Interactive GUIs[/B] — Vote overview, paginated leaderboard, streak progress, rewards/economy hub, and vote shop — all accessible with [ICODE]/vote[/ICODE].
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Bedrock Edition support[/B] — Full GUI parity for Bedrock players via Geyser/Floodgate. Cumulus forms for overview, leaderboard, streaks, rewards, and shop with purchase confirmation modals.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Vote site cooldowns[/B] — Rolling window or fixed daily reset per site. Players see exactly when they can vote again.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Vote points[/B] — Each site awards configurable points. Points are tracked separately, spent on Streak Freezes and the vote shop.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Feature toggles[/B] — Streaks, shop, leaderboard, and effects can each be independently enabled or disabled.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Daily first-vote rewards[/B] — Config-driven commands and fly-time coupon items on the first vote of the day.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Embedded REST API[/B] — HMAC-authenticated HTTP endpoints for web backend integration (sites, cooldowns, player stats). Configurable port, CORS, and per-IP rate limiting.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Broadcast & private messages[/B] — Announce votes server-wide (all / others / none) with anti-spam cooldown, plus optional private thank-you messages.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Multi-language[/B] — Ships with English, German, Czech, and Slovak translations. Add your own or override existing ones.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Record retention[/B] — Automatically purges old vote records after a configurable number of days.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]Folia compatible[/B] — Scheduled tasks run through FoliaLib for full Folia support.
[*][COLOR=#2ecc71]✦[/COLOR] [B]PlaceholderAPI[/B] — Exposes vote placeholders for scoreboards, tab lists, and more.
[/LIST]


