━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
[/CENTER]


[SIZE=4][COLOR=#f1c40f]■[/COLOR] [B]Engagement Systems[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=3][COLOR=#f1c40f]Streak Freezes[/COLOR][/SIZE]

A Streak Freeze keeps a streak alive when a player misses a day. It is fully automatic: if a vote arrives after the streak would have broken, the needed freezes are spent and the streak continues. Every player starts with one free freeze (they are told on their first vote), and more are bought with vote points through [ICODE]/vote freeze[/ICODE]. Cost, the owned cap, and how long one freeze covers are all configurable. Raise the cap per rank with [ICODE]jexvote.freeze.max.<n>[/ICODE].

[SIZE=3][COLOR=#f1c40f]Vote Gifting[/COLOR][/SIZE]

Players keep a friend's streak going when that friend cannot log in.

[LIST]
[*][ICODE]/vote gift <player>[/ICODE] — gift a streak day to a specific player.
[*][ICODE]/vote gift random[/ICODE] — gift one to a random online player.
[/LIST]

A gift advances only the receiver's streak. The daily limit defaults to one (raise it with [ICODE]jexvote.gift.daily.<n>[/ICODE]), gifting can require the gifter to have voted that day, and a player can only be gifted once per day.

[SIZE=3][COLOR=#f1c40f]Vote Jackpot[/COLOR][/SIZE]

Every vote rolls one prize from a weighted pool. The rewards menu lists each outcome with its exact drop chance and how many times it has dropped. The default pool runs from small coin wins up to a top-tier crate key — fully editable in [ICODE]rewards.yml[/ICODE].

[SIZE=3][COLOR=#f1c40f]Vote Party[/COLOR] [I](Premium)[/I][/SIZE]

A shared, server-wide counter. When votes reach the target, every player who contributed is rewarded (online players right away, offline players on next login), then the counter resets.


